#: templates/parts/space-settings-panel-moderation.php:74
msgid "Control what members can post in this space."
msgstr "Controle o que os membros podem postar neste espaço."

#: templates/parts/space-settings-panel-moderation.php:84
msgid "One word or phrase per line"
msgstr "Uma palavra ou frase por linha"

#: templates/parts/space-settings-panel-moderation.php:87
msgid ""
"One word or phrase per line, added to whatever the site already blocks. A "
"post using any of them is rejected. Whole words only, so \"art\" does not "
"block \"start\". Add * to catch variants: \"spam*\" also blocks \"spammer\"."
